The Mercedes-Benz C-Class 'C63 V8 BiTurbo' refers to the W205 generation Mercedes-AMG C63 and C63 S, produced from 2015 to 2021, which featured a 4.0-liter twin-turbocharged V8 engine. I will evaluate based on the specifications and characteristics of this model.

-   **price_usd**: Used prices for the W205 C63/C63 S vary significantly based on year, mileage, and condition, but generally fall well above the average used car price and below the ultra-luxury threshold. New prices started around $64,825 for the 2015 C63. Used prices in the UK start from £32,500, which is around $40,625 USD. This is below the average new car price but well above the lowest used car prices. Score: -0.25.
